<content>
<callout icon="📁" color="gray_bg">
	Use these assets strategically to warm up leads and handle objections. One asset, one purpose, one message — never blast everything at once.
</callout>
## 🗂️ Asset Library
- Case Study Videos: Brady is loading these into the Case Studies page — use the interim proof points there until then
- Testimonial Screenshots: coming with the case studies (Case Studies page)
- Brady's Instagram / Main Content Channel: his IG is the warm-up channel — current post links live in the Voice Kit in the Brady Onboarding hub; Daniel is adding the direct handle link here
- VSL Link: being built (funnel module) — drops here when live
- Landing Page: [https://thevaultugc.com](https://thevaultugc.com)
- Instagram / Social Proof Posts: representative posts ("new era ⏳", "real", "#niche", "game #ugc") — links in the Voice Kit; being copied here
---
## 🎯 When to Use Each Asset
- During triage call — send 1 relevant case study that matches their situation
- If they ask "does this actually work?" — send a testimonial screenshot or video
- If they ghost after booking — send a VSL clip or case study with a soft re-engagement CTA
- If they haven't watched content — send the YouTube link and make it "required" before the call
- Never blast all assets at once — pick the one most relevant to their current objection or stage
